<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's Esselte gets new head.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Esselte gets new head.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's office supply company Esselte said it had appointed Jan Kvarnstrom, currently head of Securum AB, as its new Managing Director from September 1.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
